unters/indexes, f64 for timestamps/score. ToolKind is NOT serde; hint kind may store String identical to Source id, or public helper structs manually serialize as needed. Keep the exposed API ergonomic with &mut activity mutation functions; all unchanged mutations must stay unchanged. Preserve ECMAScript UTF16 LENGTHS and common prefix/suffix code-unit comparison, ASCII-only word boundaries for hedge regex, JS whitespace rather than Rust Unicode whitespace. Use BTreeMap<usize,...> so iteration ties agree with JS numeric-key ordering; stable hint sort for strength ties (sentence, rhythm, claim, reader). Important no rewrite on merely extending; prior wording dedup only same wording then cap last5, sentence change clears rewrites/attempts, count split/join only sharedTail>=3 with Source exact trailing character set. sentenceIndex is present if strongest valid rewrite exists even if count<3; absent when most==0. Cooldown is now<until, equality allowed. readStruggle's formulas, timing and reason strings must be identical, including JSON number differences only acceptable integer vsfloat. Add a few meaningful tests translated from Source tests, not tests of helpers exclusively. Do not include GUI, providers, threads, HTTP, Cargo changes or history tracking integration. Parent will execute original Source as an independent oracle. Do not invent simplified behavior.\\n\\nFrozen input bundle follows:\\n'''+json.dumps(bundle,ensure_ascii=False)\\nprompt_path=base/'sakana-struggle-prompt.txt'; prompt_path.write_text(prompt)\\ngraph_path=base/'genui-integration-graph.json'; graph=json.loads(graph_path.read_text())\\ngraph['previousGoalTurn']='progress: owned native preview verified visible and focused with its original library preserved'\\ngraph['nodes'].append({'id':'struggle','role':'sakana-fugu-max','owns':['proposal only: src/gen_ui/struggle.rs'],'output':'Exact Source pure paragraph struggle detector','depends':[],'gate':'Parent code review and original Source execution o