{"timestamp":"2026-10-05T13:24:56.149Z","ordinal":40872,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_0acb6e766bb0227d016ac3a4fbd8ac87d1ab300da62c87f41b","status":"completed","call_id":"call_DuYJkUMO9swojUa1NEig1k5K","name":"exec","input":"text(await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"rtk proxy python3 - <<'PY'\\nfrom pathlib import Path\\nimport hashlib,json,uuid\\nroot=Path.cwd()\\nbase=root/'desktop/gpui/target/verification'\\nprep=base/('genui-parallel-inputs-'+uuid.uuid4().hex[:12]); prep.mkdir()\\ndef digest(p):return hashlib.sha256(p.read_bytes()).hexdigest()\\ndef prepare(tag,paths,task,sections):\\n bundle={str(p):{'sha256':digest(root/p)} for p in paths}\\n (prep/(tag+'-bundle.json')).write_text(json.dumps(bundle,indent=2)+'\\\\n')\\n prompt='You are an advisory Sakana Max coding subagent for the Twyne GPUI port. You are not alone in the codebase. Do not revert any other edits. Your exclusive responsibility is a proposal for the single file named below. No tools, network, or filesystem access is needed; all authoritative inputs are below. The coordinator owns integration, shared modules, UI host, cargo, and verification. Preserve exact source behavior, explain any limits, and do not claim runtime tests were executed.\\\\n\\\\n'+task+'\\\\n\\\\nReturn ONLY one JSON object with keys code (complete Rust source as a string), notes (array of strings), and cases (array of concrete verification cases). No Markdown fences.\\\\n\\\\n'\\n for path,span in sections:\\n  lines=(root/path).read_text().splitlines()\\n  content='\\\\n'.join(lines[slice(*span)])\\n  prompt+='AUTHORITATIVE INPUT '+str(path)+' (line slice '+str(span)+'):\\\\n'+content+'\\\\n\\\\n'\\n (prep/(tag+'-prompt.txt')).write_text(prompt)\\nprepare('budget',list(map(Path,['src/utils/system-one-budget.ts','src/utils/system-one-budget.test.ts'])),'''Own proposal only: desktop/gpui/src/gen_ui/budget.rs. Port the exact shared TypeScript request budget to a Rust struct SystemOneBudget using