": \\\"6e64cdf54a67687e5c51112282b6e3e36b2a888ee40a8776f5bbba742f83a5c8\\\",\\n    \\\"desktop/gpui/src/gen_ui/view.rs\\\": \\\"e58cf4b9f1c7956f3c96c47dfb62fea6a89f4932abc716cc536a4c889c1ff0d6\\\",\\n    \\\"desktop/gpui/src/gen_ui/seed.rs\\\": \\\"67880114adc4d93011aa21e214fdcaca90299be037183dd7322021ada3861ef2\\\",\\n    \\\"desktop/gpui/src/gen_ui/seed_oracle_tests.rs\\\": \\\"bf1011877217bea14a7c803d5ffba45d7b60630111daa96dfc291c5f47affc87\\\",\\n    \\\"desktop/gpui/src/gen_ui/passage.rs\\\": \\\"65a63e7741e84b55b281abdd6e812cb7b1f2579b63d13278808173edd90b32dd\\\",\\n    \\\"desktop/gpui/src/gen_ui/card.rs\\\": \\\"3d162a840dc42560f719cf6c4f2319f2a67cc4f6784410b01f29ab9e520b5ee5\\\",\\n    \\\"desktop/gpui/src/gen_ui/saved.rs\\\": \\\"e08ee041ab5e7dae4798414537fb8069114f4f366e22eb17b51b1be04c21c397\\\",\\n    \\\"desktop/gpui/src/gen_ui/notebook.rs\\\": \\\"2ad8e7a17f8c933f2ce3549c4fabeea42a69adc2562b562dfc9f4adda0dd361f\\\",\\n    \\\"desktop/gpui/src/gen_ui/position.rs\\\": \\\"9f03e40c20338b5c4ac1d1fe572599e25eee8d1f080f6adab64498fc7a13a23e\\\",\\n    \\\"desktop/gpui/src/gen_ui/store.rs\\\": \\\"53736ce4e8c334454a48ed9c99b407de47add32a44b1ca89d689879137e13742\\\",\\n    \\\"desktop/gpui/src/gen_ui/integration_oracle_tests.rs\\\": \\\"9ee0697736722e566ed91307ff6708dda2b8b8456bb0aa4cee1884e04a827d59\\\",\\n    \\\"desktop/gpui/src/gen_ui/struggle.rs\\\": \\\"3999a54e1519abe7294a0e8e37805ea6f0029aec91d3f005ee997d9c83b80406\\\",\\n    \\\"desktop/gpui/src/gen_ui/struggle_oracle_tests.rs\\\": \\\"07d52bcc3951a1a65d0eb35030db61238d60b07f0341bd5934155d2e0438389e\\\",\\n    \\\"desktop/gpui/src/gen_ui/budget.rs\\\": \\\"371ea8498f2be0d11c2c4159f8e9fbb73a2d0ae54917ecf630ac4aaefaf966e7\\\",\\n    \\\"desktop/gpui/src/gen_ui/classification.rs\\\": \\\"528668ee31a41a0898f83874db12ce8126fc33e6f816ca6574bf8cf439ad0d6a\\\",\\n    \\\"desktop/gpui/src/gen_ui/classification_oracle_tests.rs\\\": \\\"1e9ce4a74104bab100959efb1a1b335e049f77518140fd822b69bbe82cd4c3eb\\\",\\n    \\\"desktop/gpui/src/gen_ui/budget_oracle_tests.rs\\\": \\\"b0e84ae1cd3edb5e2cfecc6bb504255e8b5de46a5d17084663cba967818b2d32\\\",\\n    \\\"desktop/gpui/src/gen_ui/support_text.rs\\\": \\\"21fe8c243464fa4cc960b80239c66a0228c056b684e0070371caca714b435135\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"capturedUnix\\\": 1791208448.7234359,\\n  \\\"userPreviewReplaced\\\": false\\n}\\n\"}}"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"task\":3,\"status\":\"fulfilled\",\"value\":{\"chunk_id\":\"c3d161\",\"wall_time_seconds\":0.000018115,\"exit_code\":0,\"original_token_count\":792,\"output\":\"# In-flow writing tools\\n\\nThe full hosted Twyne desktop remains the reference. This wave covers four\\nnative tool bodies and their spec, stream and deterministic seed contracts.\\n\\n`src/gen_ui/view.rs` implements Sentence Lab, Rhythm Strip, Claim Check and\\nReader Questions with the existing original fonts, palette and Source spacing.\\nRetained inputs survive streamed props. Rhythm bars emit hover, focus and\\nselection requests. Jot and research require qualified host acknowledgments;\\na retired tool ignores late results.\\n\\nThe view is exported but **not mounted in WritingRoom**. The margin rail,\\npopover/card positioning, saved-tool shelf and naming/footer, editor commands,\\nstruggle tracking, provider requests and actual Apparatus/notebook callbacks\\nremain to be integrated. Source/native render and interaction comparisons have\\nnot been performed. Checkbox appearance, inline hint layout, stepper geometry,\\ntooltips and hover/focus paint still require that work.\\n\\nSource opens deterministic writer material without applying model-output\\nlength limits. `ToolSnapshot::seeded` and `fill_offline` preserve that behavior;\\n`ToolSnapshot::new` validates externally supplied specs. Every streamed\\ncandidate is validated, retaining its preceding snapshot on failure. A model\\ncannot rewrite the writer's sentence or earlier attempts.\\n\\nThe oracles execute unchanged Source TypeScript with `@json-render/core` 0.21.0\\nand Zod 4.4.3. They retain 45 validation results, 32 snapshots from 18 cumulative\\nstream cases, 59 deterministic seeds and offline fill results, and 11\\nsentence/word cases. The focused native tests also cover retained edits, local\\nsupport choices, exact live acknowledgments, retired requests and long writer\\nmaterial. Receipts and full logs live under `target/verification`; the current\\npointers start with `genui-`. Failed earlier receipts are retained.\\n\\nRun the Root-owned checks sequentially:\\n\\n```sh\\nrtk proxy python3 desktop/gpui/fixtures/gen-ui/check.py core\\nrtk proxy python3 desktop/gpui/fixtures/gen-ui/check.py desktop\\n```\\n\\nThese checks do not launch or replace the user's preview. No Source web/Convex\\nfile, provider registration or account data is changed by this wave.\\n\\nThe `*-proposal` directories preserve actual Sakana fugu-max outputs and inputs.\\nParent review corrected Rust syntax/types, stream tests, JS whitespace,\\nwrapper normalization, Source safe integers, sentence regex and JSON\\nconstruction. The action review remains advisory; check its statements against\\nSource when mounting the editor.\\n\\nRust/serde_json cannot represent JavaScript lone UTF-16 surrogates. That is an\\nopen parity gap for escaped model strings, changed cumulative offsets inside a\\npair, and support labels sliced through a pair at 60 units. Unsupported label\\nedits currently preserve the writer's input.\\n\\nThe next integration must translate Source `textContent`/`posAtOffset` through\\nthe native rich document model, preserve marks and undo, and qualify callbacks\\nby folio, visit and tool identity. ProseMirror offsets cannot be copied into\\nnative scalar coordinates. Connected account, knowledge-base and AI transport\\nwork remains part of the full port objective.\\n\"}}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a10c6f-d724-7b02-bb99-7845fa255153","create_time":1791210242.1157763}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
