limits, idempotency, cancellation, durable records, filesystem/workspace, bounded networking, secrets mediation, artifact export, resource limits, and provenance remain outside Cloudflare. Cloudflare, microVM, self-hosted runner, or future provider are adapters. [Task 1] [ad-hoc note]\n  1888\t- Private release uses `SKIP=notorganic-railway`; explicitly push `refs/tags/v0.1.1` and inspect private refs/visibility. Release commit `cbb38d23336fa37416fda29ffed8458bb369d1d2` and annotated tag `v0.1.1` were verified. Exclude `.zero/cache/`, preserve `.zero/cbb38d23336fa37416fda29ffed8458bb369d1d2` as local output, and keep the Rad Garden note as an evaluation only. GitNexus found 125 files/377 symbols/67 affected flows at critical risk, so disclose its broad auth/billing/gateway/portal/signup impact. [Task 2]\n  1889\t\n  1890\t## Failures and how to do differently\n  1891\t\n  1892\t- Do not call legal/mail/payment launch ready without French review, qualifying operator address/contact/retention controls, DNS+SPF/DKIM/DMARC and external mail proof, Paddle.js/browser payment/webhook/grant proof. Cloudflare containers were blocked by Workers Paid plan `401 Unauthorized`; gateway remains disconnected. [Task 1]\n  1893\t- `--follow-tags` is not enough Radicle advertised-tag proof: explicitly push the tag and verify `rad inspect --refs`. Sandbox `EPERM` for Bun listening/GitNexus, `.git` writes, and SSH-agent access are execution-environment blockers, not code failures; retry narrowly with required access. [Task 2]\n  1894\t\n  1895\t# Task Group: /home/diogenes/Projects/stich multi-account identity and durable System One inbox agent\n  1896\tscope: Put account switching in the expected profile area and maintain an approval-gated, typed, durable inbox-judgement architecture.\n  1897\tapplies_to: cwd=/home/diogenes/Projects/stich; reuse_rule=recheck mailbox principals, funding, deployment/runtime, secret rotation, and policy state before enabling automatic judgments or notifications.\n  1898\t\n  1899\t## Task 1: Implement profile-area account switching and inbox judgement worker\n  1900\t\n  1901\t### rollout_summary_files\n  1902\t\n  1903\t- rollout_summaries/REDACTED.md (cwd=/home/diogenes/Projects/stich, rollout_path=/home/diogenes/.codex/sessions/2026/09/21/rollout-2026-09-21T04-17-25-01a0c30a-953a-7602-880d-b6adcfa77d71.jsonl, updated_at=2026-09-21T09:39:24+00:00, thread_id=01a0c30a-953a-7602-880d-b6adcfa77d71, partial; deployment/manual synthetic evaluation, automation paused)\n  1904\t\n  1905\t### keywords\n  1906\t\n  1907\t- AccountSwitcher, serverOrigin::principal, TypeSafe System One, durable-inbox.ts, atomic disk journal, stich-agent, node:sqlite, Node 22, HTTP 402, policy disabled\n  1908\t\n  1909\t## User preferences\n  1910\t\n  1911\t- account switching should be “in a sensible place like where the profile image is like other email clients” -> put it inside/adjacent to profile identity rather than a separate top strip. [Task 1]\n  1912\t- for “system one judge integration,” classification/actions/notifications, Not Organic, sandbox, and Trigger.dev-like durability -> use typed reusable judgments, code-owned actions, and approval gates, not opaque generative automation. “Leave it unfunded for now” means automatic judgments stay off. [Task 1]\n  1913\t\n  1914\t## Reusable knowledge\n  1915\t\n  1916\t- Auth stores redacted `accounts[]`; account identity is `${serverOrigin}::${principal}`. Switching resets workspace/query/UI state and selected-account logout removes only that account. [Task 1]\n  1917\t- TypeSafe worker asks seven per-message typed questions and batches at most eight. It stores no mail bodies/credentials in its atomic journal; it validates account/owner/signature/capability/DPoP/freshness/replay and does not authorize sending/deleting/paying/link following/executing email code. [Task 1]\n  1918\t\n  1919\t## Failures and how to do differently\n  1920\t\n  1921\t- Initial chooser placement above workspac