tains target check).\",\n      \"Document keydown Escape closes menu when open.\",\n      \"menuOpen is the external `open` Signal if provided, otherwise internal useSignal(false).\",\n      \"Every nav item sets menuOpen=false before nav().\",\n      \"Invitation Open sets menuOpen=false before nav; Decline does not close.\",\n      \"Invitation Decline sets invitationBusy to lixId, clears invitationError, calls rejectInvitation mutation, removes item on success, sets error on failure, always clears busy.\",\n      \"AuthPanel sign-in sets redirecting=true, remembers auth attempt, captures product event, calls startNotOrganicSignIn(returnTo), and on throw clears attempt, reports diagnostic, normalizes error, captures failure event, shows notice, resets redirecting.\",\n      \"AuthPanel loading shows '…loading…' with no menu items beyond the label.\",\n      \"menuOpen.aria-expanded reflects open state on the trigger.\"\n    ],\n    \"unknownNativeWiring\": [\n      \"External control of `open` via a Signal is a Source contract; native equivalent (if any) is unknown.\",\n      \"Auth identity source, accountDisplayName/accountInitials inputs, and avatar validity come from utils (account-display.ts) and auth-context; native providers unknown.\",\n      \"Sign-out implementation (signOut), Not Organic redirect (startNotOrganicSignIn) target and network behavior are unknown and must not be inferred.\",\n      \"Invitation/shared subscriptions via Convex onUpdate (api.collaboration.listPendingInvitations, listSharedWithMe) and rejectInvitation mutation are backend wiring not visible in this Source beyond call names; capabilities unknown.\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"styling\": {\n    \"verifiedTokensAndClasses\": [\n      \"icon-btn: inline-flex, min 1.75rem hit target, radius 2px, color var(--color-ink-muted), hover color var(--color-ink) + bg var(--color-paper-2), active scale(0.9), focus-visible 2px solid var(--color-vermilion) offset 1px.\",\n      \"folio: bg var(--color-p