dFolios.length > 0\",\n          \"heading\": \"Shared with me\",\n          \"item\": {\n            \"element\": \"button\",\n            \"class\": \"block w-full rounded-sm px-2.5 py-2 text-left hover:bg-[var(--color-paper-soft)] focus-ring\",\n            \"action\": \"close menu, then nav(\\\"/editor?shared=\\\" + encodeURIComponent(lixId))\",\n            \"text\": \"{folioName}\",\n            \"textClass\": \"block truncate text-sm text-[var(--color-ink)]\",\n            \"subtext\": \"role === \\\"editor\\\" ? \\\"Can edit\\\" : \\\"Can comment\\\"\",\n            \"subtextClass\": \"mt-0.5 block text-[11px] text-[var(--color-ink-light)]\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"auth-panel\",\n          \"branch\": \"signed-in branch\",\n          \"label\": \"The Editor's Office (dept-label)\",\n          \"line1\": \"On the masthead\",\n          \"line2\": \"{accountDisplayName(user)}\",\n          \"button\": \"Sign out\",\n          \"buttonAction\": \"signOut()\"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  },\n  \"interactions\": {\n    \"verified\": [\n      \"Trigger click toggles menuOpen.value.\",\n      \"Document click closes menu when target is outside rootRef (rootRef contains target check).\",\n      \"Document keydown Escape closes menu when open.\",\n      \"menuOpen is the external `open` Signal if provided, otherwise internal useSignal(false).\",\n      \"Every nav item sets menuOpen=false before nav().\",\n      \"Invitation Open sets menuOpen=false before nav; Decline does not close.\",\n      \"Invitation Decline sets invitationBusy to lixId, clears invitationError, calls rejectInvitation mutation, removes item on success, sets error on failure, always clears busy.\",\n      \"AuthPanel sign-in sets redirecting=true, remembers auth attempt, captures product event, calls startNotOrganicSignIn(returnTo), and on throw clears attempt, reports diagnostic, normalizes error, captures failure event, shows notice, resets redirecting.\",\n  