00 -> inspect `<title>Error</title>`, `Cannot find module`, expected app markers, and console output before treating the preview as healthy. [Task 1]\\n/home/diogenes/.codex/memories/MEMORY.md:494:# Task Group: /home/diogenes/Projects/twyne fluid manuscript editor, House attention policy, and Claude-work continuation\\n/home/diogenes/.codex/memories/MEMORY.md:506:- all in flow, flow-surface.tsx, flow-ribbon.tsx, manuscript-panel.tsx, twyne-editor.tsx, margin-surface.ts, MARGIN_SLOT_EVENT, OPEN_MARGIN_THREAD_EVENT, pneumatic post, galley slip, way in, 5180\\n/home/diogenes/.codex/memories/MEMORY.md:520:- when shaping the manuscript experience, the user wants it “all in flow,” with the side panel retained for deliberate browsing -> prioritize inline margin surfaces, quiet queues, and progressive disclosure over new panel-first workflows [Task 1]\\n/home/diogenes/.codex/memories/MEMORY.md:687:scope: Make Typst authoring/proof and generated initial artwork feel native to Twyne’s paper/ink/vermilion writing desk while preserving editable manuscript text, export fidelity, and explicit publication gates.\\n/home/diogenes/.codex/memories/MEMORY.md:708:- illuminated-initials, drop-cap, imagegen, transparent-assets, AVIF, Typst, browser-print, twyne-release-023, landing-options, manuscript garden\\n/home/diogenes/.codex/memories/MEMORY.md:721:- The current drop cap is CSS-driven at `.twyne-editor .ProseMirror > p:first-of-type::first-letter`; artwork must layer around the editable opening character, not replace manuscript text. Relevant helpers include `src/utils/illuminated-initials.ts`, `print-ornaments.ts`, `page-ornaments.ts`, and `src/utils/typst/decorative-assets.ts`. [Task 2]\\n/home/diogenes/.codex/memories/MEMORY.md:728:- A successful isolated commit is not publication. The gallery at `public/assets/landing/options-2026-09/index.html` contains five options; option 3 “the manuscript garden” was only an assistant recommendation and publication remains on hold. [Task 2]\\n\"}}}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a10d17-989f-7150-9fa5-0c502f3fed47","create_time":1791221048.8642883}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
