g</h1><p><strong><em>${prose.slice(0, 40)}</em></strong><a href=\\\"https://example.com\\\">${prose.slice(40, 120)}</a>${prose.slice(120)}</p><p>Later prose.</p>`;\\nsrc/utils/typst/serialize.test.ts:187:      '<h1>Ornament</h1><p>“<strong><em>At last</em></strong>, <span style=\\\"color:#224466\\\">the page</span> came alive.</p><p>Later prose.</p>';\\nsrc/utils/typst/serialize.test.ts:295:      <h1>Typeset manuscript</h1>\\nsrc/utils/typst/serialize.test.ts:365:      '<h1>Proof</h1><p>A <strong>bold</strong> sentence.</p><ol><li><p>First</p></li><li><p>Second</p></li></ol><table><tbody><tr><th><p>A</p></th><th><p>B</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>One</p></td><td><p>Two</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Three</p></td><td><p>Four</p></td></tr></tbody></table><div data-type=\\\"page-break\\\"></div><p>Page two.</p>';\\nsrc/utils/exchange-print.test.ts:80:    expect(html).toContain(\\\"<h1>Specimen</h1>\\\");\\nsrc/utils/exchange-print.test.ts:86:    const html = exportHtml(payload({ html: \\\"<h1>Specimen</h1><p>Body.</p>\\\" }));\\nsrc/utils/exchange-print.test.ts:88:    expect(html.match(/<h1>Specimen<\\\\/h1>/g)).toHaveLength(1);\\nsrc/utils/document.ts:32:    title: extractTitle(text),\\nsrc/utils/document.ts:46: * `store.meta.title` re-renders when the title changes, not when the writer\\nsrc/utils/document.ts:61:function extractTitle(text: string): string {\\nsrc/utils/convex-sync.test.ts:559:      onUpdate: (\\nsrc/utils/exchange-import.test.ts:82:  <h1>Field notes</h1>\\nsrc/utils/ai-client.ts:3335:  onUpdate?: (update: InterviewStreamUpdate) => void,\\nsrc/utils/ai-client.ts:3391:    if (onUpdate) {\\nsrc/utils/ai-client.ts:3411:          onUpdate(createInterviewStreamSnapshot(rawText, nativeReasoning));\\nsrc/utils/ai-client.ts:3567:    if (onUpdate) {\\nsrc/utils/product-analytics.test.ts:175:        \\\"<h1>Opening</h1><p>One <strong>careful</strong>&nbsp;sentence &amp; another.</p><script>secret words</script>\\\",\\nsrc/utils/auth-context.tsx:223:                unsubscr