)\n- convex-migration-helper: Plans Convex schema and data migrations with widen-migrate-narrow and @convex-dev/migrations. Use for breaking schema c (file: r12/convex-migration-helper/SKILL.md)\n- convex-monitor: Watch for the next dev/prod error or request in a Convex app and react to it. (file: r12/convex-monitor/SKILL.md)\n- convex-optimize: Audit and optimize an existing Convex app: security, scale, upgrades, observability. (file: r12/convex-optimize/SKILL.md)\n- convex-performance-audit: Audits Convex performance for reads, subscriptions, write contention, and function limits. Use for slow features, ins (file: r12/convex-performance-audit/SKILL.md)\n- convex-quickstart: Get a barebones Convex + web template running from a one-sentence idea. (file: r12/convex-quickstart/SKILL.md)\n- convex-reviewer: Convex code reviewer — security, auth, validators, performance, and pattern checks for code in a convex/ directory. U (file: r12/convex-reviewer/SKILL.md)\n- convex-seed: Seed or import data into the Convex database. (file: r12/convex-seed/SKILL.md)\n- convex-self-heal: Production error → triaged, root-caused, repaired, and certified (tsc + rehearsal + reproduce-then-gone) fix PR for a h (file: r12/convex-self-heal/SKILL.md)\n- convex-sentinel: Set up Sentinel production error capture in your own Convex deployment. (file: r12/convex-sentinel/SKILL.md)\n- convex-setup-auth: Sets up Convex auth, identity mapping, and access control. Use for login, auth providers, users tables, protected funct (file: r12/convex-setup-auth/SKILL.md)\n- convex-ship: Publish the current Convex app to a live *.convex.app URL (deploy backend + upload web build). (file: r12/convex-ship/SKILL.md)\n- convex-suggest: Suggest the matching Convex component when the user hand-rolls a pattern it already solves (crons, sharded-counter, r (file: r12/convex-suggest/SKILL.md)\n- convex-test: Generate convex-test tests for the app's Convex functions. (file: r12/convex-test/SKILL.md)\n- convex-verify: Pr