ehearsal + reproduce-then-gone) fix PR for a h (file: r12/convex-self-heal/SKILL.md)\n- convex-sentinel: Set up Sentinel production error capture in your own Convex deployment. (file: r12/convex-sentinel/SKILL.md)\n- convex-setup-auth: Sets up Convex auth, identity mapping, and access control. Use for login, auth providers, users tables, protected funct (file: r12/convex-setup-auth/SKILL.md)\n- convex-ship: Publish the current Convex app to a live *.convex.app URL (deploy backend + upload web build). (file: r12/convex-ship/SKILL.md)\n- convex-suggest: Suggest the matching Convex component when the user hand-rolls a pattern it already solves (crons, sharded-counter, r (file: r12/convex-suggest/SKILL.md)\n- convex-test: Generate convex-test tests for the app's Convex functions. (file: r12/convex-test/SKILL.md)\n- convex-verify: Prove a Convex feature works — seed, drive as multiple mocked users via convex-test, assert behavior including the ne (file: r12/convex-verify/SKILL.md)\n- typesafe-ai: Build AI-powered software with TypeSafe: small units of AI intelligence you can use like programming primitives. Its Sy (file: r12/typesafe-ai/SKILL.md)\n- antithesis-property-testing: Design, review, and strengthen property tests and Antithesis workloads. Use when creating or evaluating invariants, choo (file: r0/antithesis-property-testing/SKILL.md)\n- approved-logo-raster-production: Produce faithful raster logo families from an approved identity sheet or rendered reference. Use when the user prefers t (file: r0/approved-logo-raster-production/SKILL.md)\n- charm-railway-dhall: Maintain and deploy the Charm + skate setup in /home/diogenes/setup-store using charm-railway.dhall as source of truth a (file: r0/charm-railway-dhall/SKILL.md)\n- docs: docs (living docs people share, comment on and edit; use only when the user asks for one: names a doc, document, page (file: r1/synced/9025396c-fd4a-4bcb-bdee-defa5142c6e3_9af5a73e-064f-4898-b319-cbdd66ff983b/docs/SKILL.md)\n- documents