ssier text was “too similar” and requested a pulse -> use semantically mapped Reicon controls, concise differentiated copy, and subtle reduced-motion-safe missing-state emphasis; the later “the text is a bit redundant” means the final wording remains unresolved [Task 2]\\n839:- when the user said “the side panel is fine but i want to get everything all in flow” -> prioritize inline/margin surfaces and quiet queues, not panel-first navigation [Task 3]\\n840-- when the user said “go User interface first here, the backend you can send off to codex” -> prioritize the writer-facing UI and use bounded backend delegation rather than delaying the visible slice [Task 3]\\n\"}}}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a10d4c-a644-7d71-9054-bf5cd3583d03","create_time":1791227887.9423397}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
