al_compile_keeps_source_and_uses_original_artwork_in_svg_and_pdf ... ok\\ntest app::tests::versions_do_not_replace_new_native_typing_or_pending_source ... ok\\ntest app::dossier_filing_tests::late_error_cannot_replace_reopened_form_state_or_take_its_focus ... ok\\ntest app::dossier_filing_tests::late_durable_success_cannot_clear_reopened_same_scope_recovery_or_move_focus ... ok\\ntest app::tests::source_compiles_after_the_original_quiet_period_and_retains_the_last_valid_proof ... ok\\ntest app::tests::versions_restore_preserves_the_current_draft_and_saves_real_checkpoints ... ok\\ntest app::tests::writing_and_notebook_save_through_real_controls ... ok\\ntest app::tests::page_selector_navigates_the_real_proof_and_retains_selection_across_modes ... ok\\ntest app::dossier_filing_tests::real_filing_failure_retains_draft_and_retry_saves_before_recovery_cleanup has been running for over 60 seconds\\ntest app::dossier_retained_settings_host::retained_dossier_settings_theme_and_back_keep_actual_title_and_scope has been running for over 60 seconds\\ntest app::tests::switching_drafts_flushes_typing_before_the_autosave_delay ... ok\\ntest app::dossier_retained_settings_host::retained_dossier_settings_theme_and_back_keep_actual_title_and_scope ... ok\\ntest app::dossier_filing_tests::real_filing_failure_retains_draft_and_retry_saves_before_recovery_cleanup ... ok\\n\\ntest result: ok. 115 passed; 0 failed; 0 ignored; 0 measured; 0 filtered out; finished in 82.39s\\n\\n\"}}}"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"part\":1,\"result\":{\"status\":\"fulfilled\",\"value\":{\"chunk_id\":\"43b248\",\"wall_time_seconds\":0.000012499,\"exit_code\":0,\"original_token_count\":91,\"output\":\"{\\\"receipt\\\": \\\"/home/diogenes/Projects/twyne/desktop/gpui/target/verification/user-preview-insert-title-d9744314da87/launch.json\\\", \\\"screenshot\\\": \\\"/home/diogenes/Projects/twyne/desktop/gpui/target/verification/user-preview-insert-title-d9744314da87/window.png\\\", \\\"pid\\\": 51549, \\\"windowId\\\": \\\"0xa00001\\\", \\\"clientPixels\\\": {\\\"width\\\": 948, \\\"height\\\": 996}, \\\"focused\\\": true}\\n\"}}}"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"part\":2,\"result\":{\"status\":\"fulfilled\",\"value\":{\"chunk_id\":\"99adb9\",\"wall_time_seconds\":0.000015315,\"exit_code\":0,\"original_token_count\":573,\"output\":\"# In-document insertion\\n\\n`src/insert_menu/` is independent of the writing-room host. Source's 17 editable,\\ncollapsed-selection commands supply the catalog, descriptions, grouping, search\\nterms and keywords. Native adds `insert.link` at the user's request. The differential\\nfilter check compares the Source subset separately from that addition.\\n\\nRegenerate or check these fixtures by running the actual original registry:\\n\\n```bash\\nrtk proxy bun desktop/gpui/tools/sync-insert-menu.ts --check\\nrtk proxy bun desktop/gpui/tools/sync-insert-menu.ts\\n```\\n\\n`source-receipt.json` records the initial snapshot's input hashes. Regeneration\\ndoes not rewrite that historical receipt. Later capture/build receipts record\\ntheir own inputs.\\n\\n`capture-source.ts` drives the real web editor in an isolated browser and IDB\\nlibrary. It records the menu's actual fonts, bounds and styles and exercises\\nfiltering, arrows, Escape and heading insertion. It waits for Source's asynchronous\\ncommand completion before typing the heading's content.\\n\\n```bash\\nrtk proxy bun desktop/gpui/fixtures/insert-menu/capture-source.ts /tmp/new-source-insert-capture\\n```\\n\\nThe local Vite reference must already be running on `127.0.0.1:5207` (override\\n`TWYNE_INSERT_SOURCE_URL` with another loopback origin). This is browser evidence,\\nnot Electrobun-host or real-account evidence.\\n\\nNative `tools/capture-native.py` accepts `slash`, `slash-filtered`, and `slash-form`.\\nUse a synthetic `.twyne`/HTML fixture whose final paragraph ends with `/` or\\n`/table`. Capture mode only places the caret and opens the menu; it does not\\ninsert a diagnostic slash into the user's writing. Run with an immutable build\\nand isolated library.\\n\\nMarkdown and rich adapters apply the query removal and insertion as one undoable\\nedit. Native parameter forms leave the query untouched until commit, including\\nwhen cancelled; Source removes its query before opening a parameter dialog.\\nNative also clamps the popup to the visible window. Exact parameter-dialog styling\\nand Source shortcut hints remain comparison work.\\n\\nSakana's bounded catalog/filter/Markdown/review outputs are retained under\\n`advisory-*`. Each has a root adoption review. Only the fuzzy scorer was adopted\\nas model-produced code; its results are checked against 21 actual Source queries.\\n\"}}}"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"part\":3,\"result\":{\"status\":\"fulfilled\",\"value\":{\"chunk_id\":\"26c642\",\"wall_time_seconds\":0.000010874,\"exit_code\":0,\"original_token_count\":66,\"output\":\"  4380 desktop/gpui/src/app.rs\\n   335 desktop/gpui/src/app/room_layout.rs\\n  2536 desktop/gpui/src/app/tests.rs\\n   190 desktop/gpui/src/app/manuscript_coordinator.rs\\n   520 desktop/gpui/src/app/slash_coordinator.rs\\n    85 desktop/gpui/ARCHITECTURE.md\\n  8046 total\\n\"}}}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a10d4c-a644-7d71-9054-bf5cd3583d03","create_time":1791228157.6150885}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
