{"timestamp":"2026-10-05T19:29:42.254Z","ordinal":44750,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_0e6e2e948f59cffe016ac3fa9ed50487d1b9015a8d4caa1c5a","status":"completed","call_id":"call_HlpEDPl0DOc3iv0vcyy01RuZ","name":"exec","input":"text(await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"rtk proxy python3 - <<'PY'\\nimport hashlib,json\\nfrom pathlib import Path\\nroot=Path.cwd(); out=root/'desktop/gpui/target/verification'\\nfiles=['src/components/ui/text-modal.tsx','src/components/editor/insert-panels.tsx','desktop/gpui/src/insert_menu/form.rs','desktop/gpui/src/insert_menu/parameters.rs']\\nbundle={file:{'sha256':hashlib.sha256((root/file).read_bytes()).hexdigest(),'text':(root/file).read_text()} for file in files}\\n(out/'sakana-insert-modal-input.json').write_text(json.dumps(bundle,indent=2)+'\\\\n')\\nprompt='''You are an advisory subagent for the Twyne GPUI port. You are not alone in the codebase. You have no tools and must not edit or request any files. Ownership: read-only Source note/Mermaid modal contract review. Root owns implementation, integration and validation. Return one JSON object only. Using only the frozen files below, extract exact Source text-modal structure, labels/copy/placeholders, dimensions/padding/typography/color tokens and button styles; focus/keyboard/backdrop/cancellation behavior; Mermaid preview behavior and empty-submit behavior. Compare with current native InsertFormView and list concrete mismatches with line-level function/component references. Include a short test matrix of observable interactions. Do not invent missing behaviors or redesign the product. Do not propose preserving native behavior when Source differs. Do not analyze table/image/math except if needed to distinguish their flows. Keep response under 4500 words.\\\\n\\\\nFrozen source bundle:\\\\n'''+json.dumps(bundle)\\n(out/'sakana-insert-modal-prompt.txt').write_text(prompt)\\nprint(json.dumps({'files':len(files),'characters':len(prompt),'scope':'advis