_grow(1,1).submit_on_enter(true) (39-43)\",\"Table seeds '3'/'3' (44-47)\",\"subscribe both: Change -> clear error; PressEnter{shift:false} -> submit (48-60)\",\"primary set_selected_range(0..len) + focus on new (61-64)\"],\"submit\":[\"current_values -> kind.values(primary,secondary,header) (74-80)\",\"submit: Ok -> emit Insert, Err -> error=Some(msg) + notify (81-89)\",\"cancel: emit Cancel (90-92)\"],\"labels\":\"parameters.rs: title() 48-59; primary_label() 60-69; secondary_label() 70-77; multiline() 78-83; values() 84-118; required() 121-127\"},\"mismatches\":[{\"id\":\"M1\",\"area\":\"container/overlay/backdrop\",\"source\":\"fixed inset-0 centered overlay, scrim rgba(20,16,10,0.58), z-modal, dialog max-w-lg (notes) / max-w-4xl (mermaid), p-5\",\"native\":\"bare 320px floating column, no overlay/scrim/centering, p16 gap12\",\"source_ref\":\"text-modal.tsx:120-140\",\"native_ref\":\"form.rs:114-130\",\"severity\":\"high\"},{\"id\":\"M2\",\"area\":\"backdrop click cancellation\",\"source\":\"click on overlay (target===currentTarget) cancels\",\"native\":\"none (only occlude); no outside-click cancel\",\"source_ref\":\"text-modal.tsx:126-130\",\"native_ref\":\"form.rs:114-130\",\"severity\":\"high\"},{\"id\":\"M3\",\"area\":\"kicker vs title structure\",\"source\":\"optional kicker (dept-label mb-2) above a distinct h2 title\",\"native\":\"dept_label(kind.title()) only; no kicker, no title heading\",\"source_ref\":\"text-modal.tsx:141-148; insert-panels.tsx:67,82\",\"native_ref\":\"form.rs:159\",\"severity\":\"high\"},{\"id\":\"M4\",\"area\":\"title copy\",\"source\":\"'Footnote' / 'Endnote' / 'Mermaid diagram'\",\"native\":\"'Insert a footnote' / 'Insert an endnote' / 'Insert a diagram'\",\"source_ref\":\"insert-panels.tsx:8,16,83\",\"native_ref\":\"parameters.rs:56,57,53\",\"severity\":\"high\"},{\"id\":\"M5\",\"area\":\"description paragraph\",\"source\":\"per-modal description under title\",\"native\":\"absent\",\"source_ref\":\"text-modal.tsx:149-153; insert