ult());\n+        assert_eq!(editor.document(), &before);\n+        assert!(!editor.can_undo());\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+#[test]\n fn closed_section_moves_preserve_nested_content_metadata_and_exact_one_step_undo() {\n","move_path":null},"/home/diogenes/Projects/twyne/desktop/gpui/src/editor/transaction.rs":{"type":"update","unified_diff":"@@ -1303,3 +1303,6 @@\n     };\n-    if head.node.kind() != NodeKind::CodeBlock\n+    if head\n+        .node\n+        .as_element()\n+        .is_none_or(|element| element.kind != NodeKind::CodeBlock)\n         || document\n","move_path":null}},"status":"completed","stdout":"Success. Updated the following files:\nM /home/diogenes/Projects/twyne/desktop/gpui/src/editor/transaction.rs\nM /home/diogenes/Projects/twyne/desktop/gpui/src/editor/tests.rs\n","stderr":""},"started_at_ms":1791230114447,"completed_at_ms":1791230114455}}
