{"timestamp":"2026-10-05T20:24:57.417Z","ordinal":45771,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a10537-909f-77a3-96d8-dd07161f91ae","turn_id":"01a10daa-98ac-7341-8bf7-59561f3acc7f","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_0e6e2e948f59cffe016ac40797778087d196672b05c5e1691b","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The note dialog now has the original copy and centered layout, with multiline input and an empty-submit guard. Equations now insert a blank editable atom directly.\n\nI also found an input issue: the textarea emits an Enter event after inserting a newline. The form was treating that event as submission. I’ve corrected the handler and added a test that lets the event settle before typing the next line.\n"}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1791231895510,"completed_at_ms":1791231897417}}
